From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 23:24:07 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] fossil-hoki, virtualkeyboard, btsyncd: fix audio amp firmware
 and add phone input mode

---
