 devices/fossil-hoki/tfa9890.cnt               | Bin 0 -> 5246 bytes
 .../asteroid-btsyncd/appbridgeservice.cpp     |  39 ++++++
 .../0001-add-rime-plugin-and-layouts.patch    |   7 +-
 .../asteroidos/virtualkeyboard/default.nix    |   2 +
 .../virtualkeyboard/layouts/en_GB/main.qml    | 128 ++++++++++++++++++
